STEP 3  a knowledge shaped request, in a new conversation, again nothing chosen
  typed: Write a one page brief on how prepaid credit billing works for a new team member.
  request body the browser sent  -> {"instructions":"Write a one page brief on how prepaid credit billing works for a new team member."}
  "pack" key present in body     -> false
  pack the inference returns     -> knowledge-work-pack
  transcript says                -> Hive ran this as a knowledge work task.
